+==== Connect to a remote cluster
+
+:trust-mechanism: api-key
+include::remote-clusters-connect.asciidoc[]
+:!trust-mechanism: 
+
+include::../../../../x-pack/docs/en/security/authentication/remote-clusters-privileges-api-key.asciidoc[leveloffset=+1]
